# Cache policy for Workers Assets.
#
# There is almost nothing here any more. Every photograph in the shop — watches,
# straps, the logo, the Instagram grid — is an R2 object served by the Worker
# through /api/media, which sets its own `immutable` headers on the way out. The
# rules that used to sit here covered public/products, public/brand and
# public/instagram, and those folders are gone.
#
# Anything added back under public/ is served `max-age=0, must-revalidate` by
# default, because Workers Assets cannot know when a file that is not
# content-hashed has changed. If you add a folder of images here rather than
# uploading them, give it a rule of its own.
